# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF regardless of the platform
# a contributor works on. Without this the result depends on each machine's
# core.autocrlf setting, and CI gates that compare bytes -- `gofmt -l` and the
# generated-code drift checks -- fail for reasons unrelated to the change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be transformed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
